@startuml
' State machine for Order (status attribute OrderStatus in the class diagram)
' Stories: US-02, US-03, US-06, US-10, US-11, US-12, US-13, US-22, US-23, US-24, US-26, US-27
title Order - state machine
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5FAF7
  BorderColor #2F5D50
}

[*] --> Requested : booking request submitted /\nsend acknowledgement (US-02, US-03)

Requested --> Quoted : coordinator approves quote\n[within capacity or override] / send quote (US-06, US-10)
Requested --> Cancelled : customer withdraws\nor no date agreed

Quoted --> AwaitingDeposit : customer accepts\n[eventType = WEDDING] /\nsend 30 % Vipps request (US-22)
Quoted --> Confirmed : customer accepts\n[eventType <> WEDDING] / add covers
Quoted --> Cancelled : after(7 days) [no reply]

AwaitingDeposit --> Confirmed : deposit paid / add covers
AwaitingDeposit --> Cancelled : after(7 days) [deposit unpaid]

state Confirmed {
  [*] --> AllergiesPending
  AllergiesPending --> AllergiesConfirmed : kitchen confirms allergies (US-27)
  AllergiesConfirmed --> AllergiesPending : allergy added or changed (US-11)
}
Confirmed : change guests [now < changeDeadline] /\nupdate covers and kitchen view (US-11)
Confirmed : entry / show on kitchen screen (US-26)

Confirmed --> NumbersConfirmed : customer confirms final numbers\n(after reminder at eventDate - 7 days, US-12)
Confirmed --> Cancelled : customer cancels / apply cancellation terms (US-13)
NumbersConfirmed --> Cancelled : customer cancels / apply cancellation terms (US-13)

NumbersConfirmed --> InPreparation : event day starts\n[allergies confirmed]
InPreparation --> Delivered : food delivered
Delivered --> Invoiced : invoice created in Fiken /\nVipps (private) or monthly EHF (company) (US-23, US-24)

Invoiced --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Cancelled
  A cancellation fee, if any, is invoiced
  separately. The terms are open question C08.
end note
@enduml
